@baseUrl = http://localhost:5220
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@consultationId = 0

### Admin: list inquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/consultations?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: permanently delete a handled inquiry (204; missing ID 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/consultations/{{consultationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
